PATTERN: Falling Wedge
CATEGORY: reversal
TIMEFRAME: daily
DEFINITION: Lower highs and lower lows, converging with highs falling faster - loss of downside thrust.
WHEN IT FIRES: Bullish reversal - trigger on close above the upper trendline.
RELIABILITY: Moderate to high after downtrends.
FALSE POSITIVES: In strong bear phases falling wedges break down cleanly.
EXAMPLE: NIFTY 2022-06 bottom. flag.ÿ